8f4e/v1

note
; @config testRuntime.enabled true

A group pointer initializer preserves the source element type and count.
noteEnd

entry test
module source
int8[] values 4 11 12 13 14
moduleEnd

group reader
expose input &processor:input
init &input &source:values

entry main
module processor
int8* input
push *input
assertEqual 11
push count(*input)
assertEqual 4
push sizeof(*input)
assertEqual 1
moduleEnd
entryEnd
groupEnd
entryEnd
